<http://data.silknow.org/object/8681ba3a-b4f5-3401-859e-048dd1688f7f/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Necklace of five squares embroidered in white beads, outlined and with a central design of maroon beads stitched in diamond shapes outlined in gilt, and arranged to form a cross. In the centre is a raised pattern of pearl and ridged gilt beads. The squares are linked by 12 graduated festoons of maroon beads. The clasp is of gilt metal, and circular with grained nodules around a moonstone centre. The medallions are embroidered on canvas and backed with silk."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/8681ba3a-b4f5-3401-859e-048dd1688f7f> .

